abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for animal and donor level comparisons of endothelial
  responses across acute EAE and chronic active multiple sclerosis cohorts.
  Includes shared gene comparisons, uncertainty summaries, endothelial subtype
  analyses, focused barrier functions, source tables and figure scripts.
